{"t":"GWW","n":"W.W. Grainger, Inc.","nKo":"W.W. 그레인저","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":1390.12,"chg":32.77,"chgPct":0.02414,"prev":1357.35,"dayH":1395.3,"dayL":1364.77,"w52H":1521.41,"w52L":929.7,"vol":376420,"avgVol":355850,"mcap":65077284864,"pe":30.55,"fpe":26.66,"eps":45.51,"feps":52.14,"pb":15.01,"div":9.96,"divY":0.0072,"beta":0.95,"short":1210388,"shortPct":0.0308,"shortRatio":5.14,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Industrials","sKo":"산업재","i":"Industrial Distribution","iKo":"산업유통","city":"Lake Forest","emp":22100,"web":"https://www.grainger.com","sum":"W.W. Grainger, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, distributes maintenance, repair, and operating products and services primarily in North America, Japan, and the United Kingdom. The company operates through two segments, High-Touch Solutions North America and Endless Assortment. It provides safety, security, material handling and storage equipment, pumps and plumbing equipment, cleaning and maintenance, and metalworking and hand tools. The company also offers technical support and inventory management services. It serves smaller businesses to large corporations, government entities, and other institutions, as well as commercial, healthcare, and manufacturing industries through sales and service representatives, and electronic and ecommerce channels. W.W. Grainger, Inc. was founded in 19","sumKo":"W.W. Grainger, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 주로 북미, 일본 및 영국에서 유지보수, 수리, 운영 제품 및 서비스를 유통합니다. 이 회사는 High-Touch Solutions North America와 Endless Assortment라는 두 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 안전, 보안, 자재 취급 및 보관 장비, 펌프 및 배관 장비, 청소 및 유지 관리, 금속 가공 및 수공구를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 또한 기술 지원 및 재고 관리 서비스도 제공합니다. 영업 및 서비스 담당자, 전자 및 전자상거래 채널을 통해 중소기업, 대기업, 정부 기관, 기타 기관은 물론 상업, 의료, 제조 업계에 서비스를 제공합니다. W.W. Grainger, Inc.는 19년에 설립되었습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":15228000000,"ni":1547000000},{"y":2023,"rev":16478000000,"ni":1829000000},{"y":2024,"rev":17168000000,"ni":1909000000},{"y":2025,"rev":17942000000,"ni":1706000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":